# PharmaLink UNILAG Coding Rules

Follow AGENTS.md, .agents/RULES.md, and the complete BLUEPRINT.md.

Key non-negotiables:
- Real functionality only (no placeholders or fake data).
- Server-side authorization and validation.
- Compact, responsive, accessible UI.
- Honest status updates in README checklist.
- No direct messages, no paid materials, UNILAG Pharmacy students only.
- Preserve existing work and inspect before changing.
